  "title": "Grilled Tri-Tip with Oregon Herb Rub",
  "description": "Tri-tip first became popular in Santa Maria, CA. This grilled tri-tip with Oregon rub recipe adds dill, sage, and rosemary to the Santa Maria recipe.",
